  "reasoning": "The facts describe two distinct criminal conduct. First, the defendant stole two electric bicycles using a prepared key to unlock and push away the bikes, then sold them for cash. This satisfies the elements of theft (盗窃罪) with a relatively large value, so the appropriate charge is 盗窃. Second, during a search the defendant was found carrying 12.45 g of heroin, methamphetamine (crystal meth/ice) and a small amount of Mahu (麻古). Possession of these controlled substances constitutes the crime of illegal possession of narcotics (非法持有毒品罪). No other conduct is described. Therefore the charges are theft and illegal possession of drugs.",
